","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83626","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c90109","characterName":"奈切沙依","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c90109"},"originalCharacterName":"奈切沙依","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"611"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hiro's classmate and student of Syouba High School. She has a firm and magnanimous personality, was pretty and had excellent grades. The entire school also chose her as their campus beauty, and the students always supported her."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Likes Tatsuhiko Tenjin."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She was the class leader before Moe Miyazawa arrived. She ran in an election against Moe, but the teacher preferred Moe because she had better grades. However, Moe had no interest in being the class leader, and chose to decline this position. This humiliated and embarrassed her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c90109"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/97d44e70e5861bc468189316ae8016bc1f7b9f5ae4059de1615ff627f47da3ca.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8ba508561db7ae75bfd3514c3f7bc38d6ed0249fed3c8bb4aa05eea3339e4cea.webp","width":188,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"白崎 透子","creatorId":"vndb:s21026","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21026","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21026","name":"白崎 透子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83628","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c90110","characterName":"天神 辰彦","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c90110"},"originalCharacterName":"天神 辰彦","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"418"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"178"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hiro's close friend and fellow member of the Syouba High School basketball team. A leading basketball member alongside Hiro. Every time something good happened to him, he shared it with Hiro."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Tatsuhiko is known as one of the two most popular boys in the school alongside Hiro. He fell in love with Moe Miyazawa at first sight."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(Description from Steam)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c90110"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8fd1a603baca096d48ce1c6c6c08d860bb0fe7c0863030faf50610f4d477b1d5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c4/c4311a227eaa3e4e18ae983e1bfb693e645d17e32d52a44d4c29e4d7f925d3a3.webp","width":187,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"しるびな","creatorId":"vndb:s21025","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21025","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21025","name":"しるびな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83627","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c90111","characterName":"藤原 佳世子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c90111"},"originalCharacterName":"藤原 佳世子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"38"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hiro's mother, and a famous writer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a very strict disciplined personality, was a career woman, knew how to create her own work and gather a variety of resources, and gave speeches. A talented, good-looking, and outstanding woman. Despite her good reputation, at home, she was nothing more than an unapproachable mother and wife. She developed a sense of persistent mistrust towards men due to her husband's affair. Although she loved her son, Hiro, she saw that some of his facial features resembled those of her ex-husband, which was always something that was difficult for her to overcome."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(Description from Steam)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c90111"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dceec8fc442df010db1a7f985045e095f17c3e5aad4504cf3ae17eedb7947ede.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf1bd128d1cad826c12d8c26dca0d6aabb5dc38c88cb7e34008cc2b12e0e9a86.webp","width":177,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c92432","characterName":"藤原 宏","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c92432"},"originalCharacterName":"藤原 宏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1227"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"176"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"His grades had always been relatively low, but he is very athletic. He is a leading member of the Syouba High School basketball team. He is close friends with Tatsuhiko Tenjin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He liked basketball, but because his mother hated it, he abandoned his opportunity to play on the school’s basketball team. Many girls liked him, and every day, they sent him all kinds of love letters and snacks. He was gentle and a meticulous thinker, and could also closely observe others’ emotional changes as well as non-emotional changes. After observing others, he adjusted his habits. In addition, he tried his best to not cause conflicts with others, as he was afraid that arguing with them would cause him to recoil, and also liked being someone who tried to never offend anyone. Although people liked him, he actually was not good at dealing with girls. Emotionally, he was a very conscientious and meticulous person."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Hiro is known as one of the two most popular boys in the school alongside Tenjin."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"After his father had an affair, his parents started an intense argument, which was when the young Fujiwara Hiro witnessed his parents’ relationship breaking apart. He discovered the ugly side of humanity, after which he found it difficult to believe in emotions, and was also no longer dedicated to his studies."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"After his parents divorced, he lived with his mother, who influenced him due to her resentment for his father. As a result, he was afraid of and hated becoming someone like his father, and was also afraid of his mother’s hateful glare due to him disappointing her. Therefore, even if girls sent him love letters, he never responded to them and was not skilled at building relationships with other people. He seemed like an optimistic person, but was not diligent about anything, and actually felt that he was very inferior to others. Due to his hesitation, he could not make decisions, and liked to avoid responsibility."